								"description": "Detail&#x73;*“The Socratic Method is where we ask Saint Socrates what to do and he tells us.”*\n\n**Prerequisite:** You convinced an NPC that your puppet is alive.\n\n**Effect:** The first time each game session that an NPC talks directly to your hand puppet, you gain a hero token. Once during any conversation or negotiation when you use a skill from the Interpersonal skill group you can have Saint Socrates speak instead, gaining an extra edge on the roll.",
